 wanted it to feel like an  emotional reunion between the mother and  the son what is the process of getting  your shorts were selected are there  other shorts since whatever competition  at Pixar what is that process for  production for choosing it  ah so for me I I kind of was in this  American Idol style like audition  process at Pixar cuz they asked like  anybody in the studio if they had ideas  for the next short film to pitch three  ideas to a panel of judges so I signed  up and I was one of like 50  I think people pitching that day so I  worked really hard for the next couple  of weeks and I did drawings of each of  my three ideas put them up on boards and  I'm like we I wheeled it in to this room  and it you know they were all sitting  there like directors executives  producers we're just sitting there in a  row I was in the front you know and then  I like went through each of my ideas and  I went through multiple rounds you know  because there's like elimination round  oh yeah until finally  bowel was chosen was greenlit as the  next official Pixar theatrical short and  I was in 2015  you
 

